								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I&#039;m voting Bush.&nbsp; National security and taxes are my biggest issue, and like most people I&#039;m much more comfortable with Cheney as president than Edwards if something happens to the CIC.<br /><br />I don&#039;t like Kerry, he&#039;s opportunistic with a capital O.&nbsp; But my vote comes completely from what I like in Bush, not what I don&#039;t like in Kerry.
						</td>
